 "posts": [
  "POWER RESTORATION UPDATE\nAffected Areas: Portion of MUF3 - Whole core Shelter, Brgy. Igmaya-an, DSB.\nRestored at 1:19PM\nWe are pleased to inform our valued consumers that our dedicated team has successfully restored power to the affected areas of today’s scheduled power interruption. This achievement comes ahead of our projected schedule.\nWe extend our sincere gratitude for your patience, understanding, and continued support throughout the restoration efforts. Your cooperation played a vital role in enabling our teams to work efficiently and safely in the field.\nIf you are still experiencing a power outage, please do not hesitate to reach out to us. Kindly send your account details and contact number, so we can assist you as soon as possible.\nThank you once again for bearing with us. We remain committed to delivering reliable and improved electric service to our community.\nSERVICE BEYOND POWER\n#NegrosPowerRehab\n#PadayonAngRehabilitasyon\n#ForBetterElectricService",
  "SCHEDULED POWER INTERRUPTION: NOVEMBER 25, 2026\nGinapahibalo sang Negros Power ang mga konsumidores nga may ara sang natalana nga power interruption sa NOVEMBER 25, 2026 (Wednesday).\nIni kabahin sang 5-year rehabilitation kag modernization plan sang Negros Power agud malikawan ang mga wala ginalauman kag mas lapnagon nga power interruptions kag mangin reliable ang distribution system sang aton elektrisidad.\nYari ang mga detalye sang scheduled power interruption:\nDate: November 25, 2026 (Wednesday)\nReason: Reconductoring of primary bare wire to 2/0 ACSR tree wire\n9:00AM to 4:00PM\nPortion of MUF3 - Whole core Shelter, Brgy. Igmaya-an, DSB.\nMadamo gid nga salamat sa inyo nga pag hangop.\n#NegrosPowerRehab\n#PadayonAngRehabilitasyon\n#ForBetterElectricService"
 ],
